[38;2;124;124;124m**Step 3: Analyze the equation more carefully.**[0m

[38;2;124;124;124m$P(x,y)$: $f(x - f(y)) = f(x + y^n) + f(f(y) + y^n)$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mLet me set $x = -y^n$: $f(-y^n - f(y)) = f(0) + f(f(y) + y^n)$.[0m

