[38;2;124;124;124m**Step 6: Analyze the range of $h(y) = f(y) + y^n$.**[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mIf $h$ is not constant, then there exist $y_1, y_2$ with $h(y_1) \neq h(y_2)$. [0m
